<title>UK: State Bank of New South Wales sets $150 mln bond.</title>
<headline>State Bank of New South Wales sets $150 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     5.81	MATURITY    18.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA    DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
